| capped | 0.018 | 0.019 | +0.001 ± 0.011 | no |
| mean plies | 111.9 | 112.4 | +0.5 ± 3.8 | no |
| branching factor | 30.9 | 29.8 | -1.1 ± 0.7 | yes |
| killer move | 0.221 | 0.221 | +0.000 ± 0.010 | no |
